1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,150
(Sheldon(at knock on door):)Oh, perhaps it's Amy
coming to her senses.

2
00:00:02,155 --> 00:00:03,655
(music stops)

3
00:00:03,657 --> 00:00:05,557
- What's up?
- You know,

4
00:00:05,559 --> 00:00:07,589
(Leonard:)you don't need to use Sheldon
to get your way with me

5
00:00:07,594 --> 00:00:08,824
(Leonard:)in a dumb
Roommate Agreement.

6
00:00:08,829 --> 00:00:09,759
(Penny:)Where'd you get that from?

7
00:00:09,763 --> 00:00:10,693
(Leonard:)From Amy.

8
00:00:10,697 --> 00:00:13,267
(Penny:)Ugh. Amy, why did you
tell him that?

9
00:00:13,266 --> 00:00:16,436
(Amy:)Because you were defending
Sheldon like you always do.

10
00:00:16,436 --> 00:00:17,766
(Penny:)I don't always
defend Sheldon.

11
00:00:17,771 --> 00:00:19,771
(Leonard:)Oh, yes, you do.
You know you have a weird

12
00:00:19,773 --> 00:00:22,773
(Leonard:)brother-sister-Elliott-E.T.
relationship with him.

13
00:00:22,776 --> 00:00:25,706
(Penny:)What about your weird
relationship with him?

14
00:00:25,712 --> 00:00:26,742
(Leonard:)That's different.

15
00:00:26,746 --> 00:00:28,216
(Leonard:)I'm like the little girl
in Poltergeist

16
00:00:28,215 --> 00:00:30,245
(Leonard:)and he's the creepy thing
in the TV.

17
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:32,880
WOLOWITZ:
Um, guys?

18
00:00:32,886 --> 00:00:35,186
(Howard:)Were there any nuts
in that food?

19
00:00:35,188 --> 00:00:37,188
(Leonard:)I don't think so. Why?
Well...

20
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:39,990
just a feeling. (chuckles)

21
00:00:48,536 --> 00:00:50,436
(Leonard:)It just said
"Italian sub."

22
00:00:50,438 --> 00:00:53,508
(Leonard:)I had no idea mortadella
has pistachios in it.

23
00:00:53,507 --> 00:00:55,777
Interesting fact:

24
00:00:55,776 --> 00:01:01,026
In Italian, the "morta"
in "mortadella" means death.

